'''Elder Beast Naala''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] introduced in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]] that can be unlocked at a 30% chance when beating [[Immortal Zenith]] (guaranteed if a [[Treasure Radar]] is used). [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]] increases health, weaken chance and weaken duration, while also gaining [[Behemoth Slayer]] and [[Colossus Slayer]].

